{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>אל מאניא</b> — He says: like אלה." "<b>שא אזל אחת המו</b> — 'Take for yourself,' carry them down, or set them down. This is the correct interpretation." "<b>ושא</b> — from וישאו להם נשים, whose meaning is 'and they took.'"], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:41:59.649693515Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}